# MUHLNICKEL package manifest - a digest of every shipped file.
# The reader verifies all of it before it will shoot a single electron.
#   sha256          = the whole file, byte for byte.
#   sha256-machine  = the container's FABRICATED MACHINE (header, gate tables,
#                     answer plane, publish plane). The state-wire region is the
#                     input register - every shot writes it by design - so it is
#                     normalized to zero instead of hashed. Nothing else is
#                     excluded, and the container carries the same digest inside
#                     itself, so defeating this file alone is not enough.
